### ==============================================================================
### Sparnarok: The Architect's Codex - Data Ingestion API HTTP Requests
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Ingest Weapons via CSV File (multipart/form-data)
# @name uploadWeaponsCsv
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ingestion/weapons
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="weapons.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../data/seeds/weapons.csv
--WebAppBoundary--

### 2. Retrieve Ingested Weapons Catalog
# @name getIngestedWeapons
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ingestion/weapons
Accept: application/json
